nd, a woman, whose mother has recently died, throws herself into work as a form of escape. Her relentless pace is interrupted when a panic attack forces her to take a break.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":313369,\"title\":\"La La Land\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDO8zWDhfWwoFdKS4fzkUJt0Rf0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nlPCdZlHtRNcF6C9hzUH4ebmV1w.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mia, an aspiring actress, serves lattes to movie stars in between auditions and Sebastian, a jazz musician, scrapes by playing cocktail party gigs in dingy bars, but as success mounts they are faced with decisions that begin to fray the fragile fabric of their love affair, and the dreams they worked so hard to maintain in each other threaten to rip them apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":466272,\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time in... Hollywood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8j58iEBw9pOXFD2L0nt0ZXeHviB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKTPv9LKKs5L3oO1y5FNObxAPWI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Los Angeles, 1969. TV star Rick Dalton, a struggling actor specializing in westerns, and stuntman Cliff Booth, his best friend, try to survive in a constantly changing movie industry. Dalton is the neighbor of the young and promising actress and model Sharon Tate, who has just married the prestigious Polish director Roman Polanski…\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":77338,\"title\":\"The Intouchables\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1QU7HKgsQbGpzsJbJK4pAVQV9F5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q6OGlZ1KMEb14AC8KbPCxyNOal6.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A true story of two men who should never have met – a quadriplegic aristocrat who was injured in a paragliding accident and a young man from the projects.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":120467,\"title\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eWdyYQreja6JGCzqHWXpWHDrrPo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jK65srQczOKTpW62wPxwwKztGgE.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Grand Budapest Hotel tells of a legendary concierge at a famous European hotel between the wars and his friendship with a young employee who becomes his trusted protégé. The story involves the theft and recovery of a priceless Renaissance painting, the battle for an enormous family fortune and the slow and then sudden upheavals that transformed Europe during the first half of the 20th century.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1325734,\"title\":\"The Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":647600,\"title\":\"Life: Untitled\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qamiQ0BPO1IkoiAkbDWurdyccc5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p8amFt5GP2o9gCu4DJvSajZCfLS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Follows a group of female escorts who are living life as best they can.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"TE8aB3biXdw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ZQZoQs3cxc8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"cNO7zsXZHBg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","